  - key: clock.history-invalid
    text: Saved clock history is unreadable. This save is protected from writes; restore a valid backup.
  - key: clock.rewind-detected
    text: The device clock is earlier than this save's recorded time. Offline production will resume only after that recorded time is reached. Check your device date and time.
  - key: purchase.recovery-required
    text: This save contains store purchase history. Reset and restore are unavailable until purchase recovery is configured, to protect your purchases. Your current save has not been replaced.
