  - key: tutorial.build.title
    text: 1. Build
  - key: tutorial.build.body
    text: Open Build on the bottom dock and place a Lumber Camp, then a Refinery and a Warehouse.
  - key: tutorial.storage.title
    text: 2. Storage
  - key: tutorial.storage.body
    text: Your starter backpack has only 9 slots. Build a Warehouse early to store extra resources and drag stacks between grids.
  - key: tutorial.gather.title
    text: 3. Gather
  - key: tutorial.gather.body
    text: Tap a Lumber Camp, Mine or Drill on the planet to start its mini-game and collect resources.
  - key: tutorial.refine.title
    text: 4. Refine
  - key: tutorial.refine.body
    text: Tap the Refinery to turn raw resources into fuel.
  - key: tutorial.defend.title
    text: 5. Defend
  - key: tutorial.defend.body
    text: Tap the Alarm and spend fuel to call a wave. More fuel means a longer fight and bigger rewards. Gunners and Lasers defend automatically.
  - key: tutorial.travel.title
    text: 6. Travel
  - key: tutorial.travel.body
    text: Open Map on the bottom dock and spend fuel to visit new planets. Your bases stay where you built them.
  - key: tutorial.upgrade.title
    text: 7. Upgrade
  - key: tutorial.upgrade.body
    text: Open Command on the bottom dock to manage your bases and unlock upgrades, including more backpack space.
  - key: about.title
    text: FRONTIER
  - key: about.body
    text: Build bases across the stars. Gather, refine, travel, and defend your worlds from alien waves.
