    text: '{0} LY beam'
  - key: relay.beam.system
    text: system beam
  - key: relay.help
    text: Pull stacks from operational storage on other visited worlds. Each pull costs energy based on stack size and distance; only fuel in your backpack can pay. Fuel Depot reserves stay isolated.
  - key: relay.empty
    text: No remote warehouses are in range. Build storage on another visited world, or upgrade the relay to extend its beam.
  - key: relay.range.system
    text: SAME SYSTEM
  - key: relay.range.distance
