  - key: relay.blocked
    text: 'Transfer blocked: check backpack space and carried fuel.'
  - key: relay.storage-empty
    text: This storage is empty. Visit {0} and deposit resources there before pulling them through the relay.
  - key: storage.summary
    text: '{0}  -  LV {1}  -  {2} / {3} storage slots'
  - key: storage.help.fuel
    text: Fuel Depot stores ship-fuel resources only. Its upgraded racks hold larger fuel stacks; reserves stay on this planet and never pay travel costs.
  - key: storage.help.harvester
    text: This hopper stores the Auto-Harvester's offline output. A local Cargo Depot connects its materials to this planet's shared build and craft pool.
  - key: storage.help.cargo
    text: This shared buffer joins operational Warehouses and Auto-Harvester hoppers on this planet. Build and craft costs draw from the pool automatically; travel still uses your backpack.
  - key: storage.help.connected
    text: Connected to this planet's Cargo Depot. Build and craft costs can draw from this storage automatically.
  - key: storage.help.warehouse
    text: Drag a stack between the grids. Resources stay on this planet. Costs use the backpack until a Cargo Depot connects its storage.
  - key: storage.offline
    text: 'OFFLINE {0:0.#} run-eq/hr  ·  {1}h cap'
  - key: storage.filter.all
