  - key: privacy.title
    text: PRIVACY
  - key: privacy.help
    text: Controls gameplay analytics, rewarded ads, and online account, leaderboard and cloud-save features. Choices save locally and online services stay opt-in. Online services require legal, audience and account-deletion setup. Cloud copies are compared and moved only when you choose; no progress is uploaded automatically.
