  - key: cloud.title
    text: CLOUD SAVE
  - key: cloud.help
    text: No automatic upload or restore. Compare both snapshots, then choose which direction to move data. Replacing a save requires a second confirmation; the local snapshot replaced by a restore stays on this device for undo.
  - key: cloud.unavailable
    text: Cloud Save is disabled or not configured for this build.
